---
const IMG = '/illustrations';
const PUMP = 'https://pump.fun/coin/Ab16ce5SDbibTbXevxHLpqUnUvu9tNkkpaJcSDvCpump';
---
<div id="dim-future" class="page">
  <div class="f-grad"></div>
  <div class="future-hero">
    <canvas id="future-canvas"></canvas>
    <canvas id="matrix-rain" class="matrix-rain" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="f-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="f-scan" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="future-hero-text">
      <div class="f-tag rv">9 · Future · The Network</div>
      <h1 class="f-h1 rv d1">Free energy<br>for <em>everyone</em>.</h1>
      <p class="f-lead rv d2">No banks. No borders. Energy surging through the Earth to every point on the globe. Wireless, instant, free. The answer Tesla never got to give.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="f-scenes">
    <div class="f-row rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/solana-globe.jpg`} alt="The signal, transmitted worldwide on Solana" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#F2E6C4'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">The Conductor</p><h3 class="f-h3">One signal,<br>the <em>whole Earth</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">Tesla's tower became a network. The crystal in his hand is Solana. The light reaching every city is the signal he was never allowed to send.</p></div></div>
    <div class="f-row flip rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/future-world-v2.jpg`} alt="" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#F2E6C4'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">The Infrastructure</p><h3 class="f-h3">The network<br>already <em>exists</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">65,000 payments a second. A fee of a fraction of a cent. Done in under a second. Tesla's dream, running on Solana right now.</p></div></div>
    <div class="f-row rv f-solo"><div><p class="f-kicker">The Signal Lives</p><h3 class="f-h3">They silenced the tower.<br>Not the <em>frequency</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">Owned by no one. Available to everyone. The frequency Wardenclyffe was built to transmit, now permanent on the blockchain.</p><div class="rm-list"><div class="rm-i rv"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Instant ⚡ZAPP payments at live events worldwide</p></div><div class="rm-i rv d1"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Humanitarian partnerships and NGO integrations</p></div><div class="rm-i rv d2"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Micro grants. No bank, no middleman, no border</p></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="past-tesla-q fq">
    <div class="tq-369 rv" aria-hidden="true">3 · 6 · 9</div>
    <img class="tq-figure rv" src="/illustrations/369-sacred.jpg" alt="Tesla and the sacred 3·6·9" loading="lazy">
    <blockquote class="rv d1">"The present is theirs; the future, for which I really worked, is <em>mine</em>."</blockquote>
    <cite class="rv d2">Nikola Tesla</cite>
  </div>
  <div class="f-close rv"><span class="freq">3 · 6 · 9 ∞</span><h2>⚡ZAPP is the answer<br>Tesla never got to <em>give</em>.</h2><p>Decentralised. Borderless. Free for everyone. Forever.</p><button class="btn-future" data-hub style="cursor:pointer;margin-right:1rem">↩ Hub</button><a href={PUMP} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-future">Buy ⚡ZAPP</a></div>
</div>
